2. Every physics coordinate must pass through CoordinateSystem.toScreen() — no raw world coordinates on canvas.
3. All new files must be added to project.pbxproj under the correct group. Show the PBXBuildFile and PBXFileReference entries.
4. Use ThemeManager module colors: .mechanicsBlue, .wavesPurple, .thermoOrange, .emYellow, .opticsGreen, .modernRed.
5. Navigation uses AppRoute enum from Prompt 1. Never hardcode navigation destinations.
6. @EnvironmentObject dependencies: KeypadContextEngine, QuickActionPaletteState, VariableStore — never instantiate these locally.
7. After each file, confirm it compiles against the existing project structure.